## 消息接口

### 创建新对话 
POST http://localhost:8000/message/chat/create
user-token: user_123

### 获取指定对话的消息列表
GET http://localhost:8000/message/chat/chat_19125996-eb71-4989-9f2b-16c06485aaf1
user-token: user_123

### 获取用户所有对话的消息列表
GET http://localhost:8000/message/all
user-token: user_123

### 删除指定对话的所有消息
DELETE http://localhost:8000/message/chat/chat_19125996-eb71-4989-9f2b-16c06485aaf1
user-token: user_123

### 删除用户所有对话的消息
DELETE http://localhost:8000/message/all
user-token: user_123

### 生成对话标题
POST http://localhost:8000/message/chat/generate-title
Content-Type: application/json
user-token: user_123

{
  "chat_id": "chat_19125996-eb71-4989-9f2b-16c06485aaf1",
  "content": "哈罗，你好啊"
}
